graticule
=========

graticule charts counterfactual policy responses across country-by-year panels. It learns a
panel-aware transformer over a curriculum of synthetic economic structural causal models, then
reads heterogeneous treatment effects straight off the conditioned representation. The work targets
panel causal inference for macroeconomic policy and was prepared for PLOS ONE.

Sheet index
-----------
graticule/projection   panel token = covariate map + unit datum + sinusoidal clock
graticule/hachure      within-unit causal shading and cross-unit spillover bias
graticule/relief       stacked two-axis attention encoder
graticule/legend       Gaussian-mixture counterfactual head and prototype subgroup discovery
graticule/contour      factual and potential-outcome objective terms
graticule/compass      root-PEHE, coverage, regret, walk-forward and LOCO readings, signed-rank tests
graticule/chart        engraving loop: AdamW, cosine warmup, EMA, atomic checkpoints
graticule/gazetteer    synthetic-SCM cartography and benchmark adapters
graticule/cartouche    confection .cfg sheets resolved into frozen specs
graticule/burin        cyclopts entry points: engrave / read / proof / plate

Projection & datum (install)
----------------------------
pip:
  python -m pip install --extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu118 -r requirements.txt
  python -m pip install -e .
conda:
  conda env create -f environment.yml && conda activate graticule
docker:
  docker build -t graticule . && docker run --gpus all graticule read --sheet sheets/main.cfg

Compilation sources (data)
--------------------------
Reachable benchmark and macro-panel links sit in data-sources.txt with licenses and the
2026-06-25 reachability note. The synthetic curriculum runs without any download.

Engraving the plates (train)
----------------------------
primary sheet:
  bash scripts/engrave_run.sh sheets/main.cfg
ablation sheets:
  graticule engrave --sheet sheets/ablation_no_unit_fe.cfg
  graticule engrave --sheet sheets/ablation_no_spillover.cfg
  graticule engrave --sheet sheets/ablation_single_family.cfg

Reading the graticule (eval)
----------------------------
  graticule read --sheet sheets/main.cfg --ckpt engravings/atlas.pt
expected readings on the held-out plate (10 seeds), values x10^-3 where marked:
  root-PEHE (IHDP)          0.42 +/- 0.06
  ATE error (IHDP)          0.009 +/- 0.003
  interval coverage         0.94 +/- 0.01
  walk-forward RMSE gain    24-31 % over the strongest panel baseline
  LOCO transfer gap         8.3 %
tolerances are seed-to-seed; the synthetic curriculum recovers the ordering, not the third decimal.

Sheet specifications (compute)
------------------------------
Reported runs use 16 x A100-80GB, batch 96 x grad-accum 6 x world 16 (effective 9216), lr 2e-6,
700 epochs, fp32, cosine schedule with 30-epoch warmup, 850k pre-training SCMs. Wall-clock is
multi-day at this width and the figures here are not softened. Pins are torch 2.0.1 + CUDA 11.8 on
python 3.9.

Revisions
---------
0.1.0   first engraving of the panel atlas.
